arbeitnow:intern-software-test-automatio:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Test Automation Intern (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;, who will build automated tests that catch defects across our applications and services before they reach production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI Test Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Write and maintain automated browser tests using tools such as Selenium, Playwright, or Cypress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Build automated checks for REST endpoints using tools such as Postman/Newman or REST Assured.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Wire automated tests into CI pipelines such as GitHub Actions or GitLab CI so failures surface before code merges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Suite Structuring:&lt;/strong&gt; Organize test suites using frameworks such as Jest, Pytest, or JUnit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Parameterize tests so a single test case covers multiple input scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual Regression Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply tools such as Percy or Applitools to catch unintended visual changes in the interface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently enrolled in, or recently graduated from, a degree programme in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Working familiarity with at least one programming language such as JavaScript, Python, or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Basic understanding of core software-testing concepts, including test-case design and regression testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bug Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Documents issues methodically, with clear reproduction steps, in bug reports and test documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;React Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building or testing React applications, including component testing with tools such as React Testing Library.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of how frontend, backend, and database layers interact, to design more meaningful end-to-end tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Root-Cause Debugging:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to read and debug both frontend and backend code to trace a failure to its underlying cause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Python or a backend framework such as Flask, Django, or Express.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3 class="TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:remote-senior-legal-counsel-co:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;div class="elementToProof"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a commercially minded Senior Legal Counsel to join our growing legal team and support the company's global sales organisation. This is a highly collaborative role that requires strong partnership with Sales and other business stakeholders, providing pragmatic legal advice while ensuring that legal, regulatory and commercial risks are appropriately identified, assessed and managed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will act as a trusted adviser to the business, helping stakeholders navigate complex customer negotiations while exercising sound judgement regarding risk. They will understand when to find creative solutions to move discussions forward and when it is necessary to escalate, challenge assumptions or recommend alternative approaches to protect the company's interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for a confident, adaptable lawyer who thrives in a fast-paced software environment, enjoys tackling complex negotiations, and is passionate about helping the business succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with Sales, Deal Desk, Revenue Operations and other business stakeholders to support customer and channel transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the review, drafting and negotiation of a wide range of commercial agreements, including SaaS, BaaS, software, professional services, channel (including aggregator, reseller and GSI relationships) and NDAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide practical, commercially focused legal advice to Sales and business stakeholders, supporting negotiations through clear, pragmatic guidance while identifying, communicating and managing material legal, regulatory, privacy and commercial risks, and advising on compliance requirements, data protection obligations and internal approval processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop practical and defensible solutions to complex contractual and commercial issues, applying sound judgement to balance risk, identify appropriate mitigations and determine when escalation is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate potential contractual, legal or operational issues and take proactive steps to address them efficiently and reduce the risk of disputes or delays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and continuous improvement of contract templates, negotiation playbooks and legal processes, and develop and deliver training and awareness programs to promote best practices and understanding of legal risks, contracting principles and company processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with colleagues across the Legal department and contribute to a positive, high-performing team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified lawyer with significant (8-12+ years) post-qualification experience gained in a leading law firm and/or in-house legal department but including significant in-house experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial contracts background, ideally within a software, SaaS, cloud technology or broader technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent drafting, contract review and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex customer and partner agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to advise business stakeholders in a practical, succinct and commercially focused manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting sales organizations and working closely with commercial stakeholders in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on privacy and data protection issues arising in commercial technology transactions, including customer contracting requirements relating to the processing, transfer, storage and protection of data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgement and ability to assess risk proportionately. Comfortable challenging assumptions and driving constructive discussions to achieve the best outcome for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, self-motivated and willing to take ownership of complex matters from start to finish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage a high volume of matters and conflicting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, including the ability to explain complex legal concepts, articulate recommendations and options, and deliver practical advice that is accessible to a wide range of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement and the confidence to make risk-based decisions in situations where there may not be a clear precedent or established playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="content-pay-transparency"&gt;
&lt;div class="pay-input"&gt;
&lt;div class="description"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical, dental, and vision insurance with dependent enrolment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage and global 24/7 protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection after 26 weeks, covering a portion of salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined contribution pension plan with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worldwide travel insurance for business and leisure, with option to enroll dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program with therapy, legal, and financial support, plus online GP services and wellbeing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MP1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice="1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]" data-en-clipboard="true"&gt;
